---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <header class="navbar">
    <div class="container nav-container">
      <div class="logo">
        <span class="logo-text">JZAP</span>
        <span class="logo-dot"></span>
      </div>
      <nav class="nav-links">
        <a href="#services">Services</a>
        <a href="#expertise">Expertise</a>
        <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-secondary">Contact Operator</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container hero-container">
        <div class="hero-content">
          <p class="slogan">Critical Operational Support</p>
          <h1 class="display-title">
            Engineering the <span class="text-gradient">Shadow Wave</span> of the Web
          </h1>
          <p class="hero-description">
            Over 8 years of high-precision Fullstack Development and DevOps. 
            We build robust, scalable infrastructure that works relentlessly in the dark, 
            so your business can shine in the light.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a href="#services" class="btn btn-primary">Initialize Protocol</a>
            <a href="#expertise" class="btn btn-secondary">View Capabilities</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="hero-visual">
          <div class="portal-ring">
            <div class="portal-core">
              <span class="status-indicator"></span>
              <p class="status-text">System Active</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    
    <section id="factor" class="factor-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2 class="section-title">
            <svg class="title-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon></svg> 
            JZAP Factor
          </h2>
          <p class="section-subtitle">How we turn abstract ideas into strategic decisions for your project.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="factor-grid">
          <div class="card factor-card">
            <div class="card-header">
              <svg class="card-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polygon points="16.24 7.76 14.12 14.12 7.76 16.24 9.88 9.88 16.24 7.76"></polygon></svg>
              <h3 class="card-title">Strategic Clarity</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="card-text">We don't just say "yes, we can do it" at first request. Instead, we listen carefully, analyze thoroughly, and align technically before acting. Every decision is based on a deep understanding of your goals.</p>
          </div>
          
          <div class="card factor-card">
            <div class="card-header">
              <svg class="card-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M9.5 2A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 12 4.5v15a2.5 2.5 0 0 1-4.96.44 2.5 2.5 0 0 1-2.96-3.08 3 3 0 0 1-.34-5.58 2.5 2.5 0 0 1 1.32-4.24 2.5 2.5 0 0 1 1.98-3A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 9.5 2Z"></path><path d="M14.5 2A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 12 4.5v15a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 4.96.44 2.5 2.5 0 0 0 2.96-3.08 3 3 0 0 0 .34-5.58 2.5 2.5 0 0 0-1.32-4.24 2.5 2.5 0 0 0-1.98-3A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 14.5 2Z"></path></svg>
              <h3 class="card-title">Abstract Thinking</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="card-text">We approach challenges through a layered, abstract lens — distilling complex needs into structured solutions, models, or scalable systems. This mindset helps us see what others miss.</p>
          </div>
          
          <div class="card factor-card">
            <div class="card-header">
              <svg class="card-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="3" y1="9" x2="21" y2="9"></line><line x1="9" y1="21" x2="9" y2="9"></line></svg>
              <h3 class="card-title">Architectural Mindset</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="card-text">Every idea is treated like a system. We design and improve software with long-term structure, scalability, and clarity in mind — building reliable foundations, not technical debt.</p>
          </div>
          
          <div class="card factor-card">
            <div class="card-header">
              <svg class="card-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m21 16-7.172 7.172a2 2 0 0 1-2.828 0L1.828 14A2 2 0 0 1 1.828 11.172L9 4l12 12Z"></path><path d="m16 21 5-5"></path><path d="m5 10 5-5"></path></svg>
              <h3 class="card-title">Design as Leverage</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="card-text">We treat design not as decoration, but as strategic advantage — crafting interfaces, flows, and user experiences that support usability, perception, and long-term impact.</p>
          </div>
          
          <div class="card factor-card">
            <div class="card-header">
              <svg class="card-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2v20"></path><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"></path></svg>
              <h3 class="card-title">Proactive Support</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="card-text">Like a true support role, we anticipate issues, cover weak spots, and boost performance at the right moment. Our presence ensures stability, growth, and fast recovery when needed most.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="services" class="services-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header align-left">
          <h2 class="section-title">Services</h2>
          <p class="section-subtitle">Upgrade your product. Strengthen your foundation. Grow smarter.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="services-grid">
          <div class="card service-card">
            <div class="service-icon-wrapper">
              <svg class="service-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 19l7-7 3 3-7 7-3-3z"></path><path d="M18 13l-1.5-7.5L2 2l3.5 14.5L13 18l5-5z"></path><path d="M2 2l7.586 7.586"></path><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="2"></circle></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="service-title">UI/UX Design and Development</h3>
            <p class="service-text">Get beautiful, high-performing interfaces that feel intuitive and look stunning. Your users will enjoy smooth navigation, polished visuals, and a product that stands out on any device. Design and development, fused to deliver real impact.</p>
            <a href="#" class="service-link">Elevate your UI <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg></a>
          </div>

          <div class="card service-card">
            <div class="service-icon-wrapper">
              <svg class="service-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="5" r="3"></circle><line x1="12" y1="22" x2="12" y2="8"></line><path d="M5 12H2a10 10 0 0 0 20 0h-3"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="service-title">Software Architecture & Consulting</h3>
            <p class="service-text">Get evaluation, design or refactor for your project's architecture to make it robust and scalable. Clear structure, optimized performance, and technical decisions that support the future of your business.</p>
            <a href="#" class="service-link">Get Scalability <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg></a>
          </div>

          <div class="card service-card">
            <div class="service-icon-wrapper">
              <svg class="service-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"></polyline><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"></polyline></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="service-title">FullStack Development</h3>
            <p class="service-text">Build your idea with solid, scalable connections between frontend and backend. Get modular APIs, clean integrations, and fast, secure performance — all designed to grow with your product.</p>
            <a href="#" class="service-link">Build Your Idea <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg></a>
          </div>

          <div class="card service-card">
            <div class="service-icon-wrapper">
              <svg class="service-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle><path d="M19.4 15a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33 1.82l.06.06a2 2 0 0 1 0 2.83 2 2 0 0 1-2.83 0l-.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82-.33 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1 1.51V21a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 9 19.4a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82.33l-.06.06a2 2 0 0 1-2.83 0 2 2 0 0 1 0-2.83l.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33-1.82 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51-1H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2 2 2 0 0 1 2-2h.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 4.6 9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33-1.82l-.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 0-2.83 2 2 0 0 1 2.83 0l.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82.33H9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1-1.51V3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2 2 2 0 0 1 2 2v.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1 1.51 1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82-.33l.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 2.83 0 2 2 0 0 1 0 2.83l-.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33 1.82V9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.51 1H21a2 2 0 0 1 2 2 2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51 1z"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="service-title">Software Engineering & Management</h3>
            <p class="service-text">Define a clear technical path for your project, based on real engineering. Transform your goals into strategic decisions, reduce risks, manage stakeholders and align your team with targets. Improve efficiency, boost profits.</p>
            <a href="#" class="service-link">Define Your Path <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg></a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  /* Header */
  .navbar {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    width: 100%;
    padding: var(--spacing-md) 0;
    background: rgba(26, 4, 22, 0.85);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    z-index: 100;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--surface-container-high);
  }
  
  .nav-container {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }
  
  .logo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: var(--spacing-xs);
  }
  
  .logo-text {
    font-family: var(--font-brand);
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
    color: var(--on-background);
  }
  
  .logo-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    background-color: var(--electric-flash);
    border-radius: var(--rounded-full);
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--electric-flash);
  }
  
  .nav-links {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--spacing-lg);
  }
  
  .nav-links a:not(.btn) {
    font-family: var(--font-brand);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--on-surface-variant);
  }
  
  .nav-links a:not(.btn):hover {
    color: var(--primary);
  }
  
  /* Hero Section */
  .hero {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding-top: 80px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  
  .hero::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -20%;
    right: -10%;
    width: 600px;
    height: 600px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(168, 21, 155, 0.15) 0%, rgba(26, 4, 22, 0) 70%);
    border-radius: 50%;
    z-index: -1;
  }
  
  .hero-container {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--spacing-xl);
    align-items: center;
  }
  
  .slogan {
    font-family: var(--font-brand);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--primary);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
    display: inline-block;
    border: 1px solid var(--surface-container-high);
    padding: var(--spacing-xs) var(--spacing-sm);
    border-radius: var(--rounded-sm);
    background: var(--surface-container-lowest);
  }
  
  .display-title {
    font-size: 64px;
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
  }
  
  .hero-description {
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--on-surface-variant);
    max-width: 90%;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
  }
  
  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--spacing-md);
  }
  
  /* Portal Visual */
  .hero-visual {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
  }
  
  .portal-ring {
    width: 380px;
    height: 380px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px dashed var(--outline-variant);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    position: relative;
    animation: spin 30s linear infinite;
  }
  
  .portal-ring::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: -20px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    border-top-color: var(--shadow-wave);
    border-bottom-color: var(--electric-flash);
    opacity: 0.3;
    animation: spin 15s linear infinite reverse;
  }
  
  .portal-core {
    width: 240px;
    height: 240px;
    background: var(--surface-container);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--spacing-sm);
    box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(168, 21, 155, 0.2);
    animation: pulse 4s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
  }
  
  /* Prevent inner content from spinning */
  .portal-core > * {
    animation: spin 30s linear infinite reverse;
  }
  
  .status-indicator {
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    background-color: var(--electric-flash);
    border-radius: 50%;
    box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--electric-flash);
  }
  
  .status-text {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--on-background);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  
  @keyframes spin {
    from { transform: rotate(0deg); }
    to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
  }
  
  @keyframes pulse {
    from { box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(168, 21, 155, 0.1); }
    to { box-shadow: 0 0 60px rgba(160, 35, 200, 0.4); }
  }
  
  /* Factor Section */
  .factor-section {
    padding: var(--spacing-xl) 0;
    min-height: 50vh;
  }
  
  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: 40px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: var(--spacing-sm);
    color: var(--on-background);
  }
  
  .title-icon {
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    color: var(--electric-flash);
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 12px rgba(160, 35, 200, 0.6));
  }
  
  .section-subtitle {
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--on-surface-variant);
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: var(--spacing-md) auto 0;
  }

  .factor-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: var(--spacing-lg);
  }
  
  .factor-grid > .card {
    width: calc(33.333% - (var(--spacing-lg) * 2 / 3));
    min-width: 300px;
  }
  
  .factor-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--spacing-md);
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, var(--surface-container), var(--surface-container-lowest));
    border: 1px solid var(--surface-container-high);
  }
  
  .card-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--spacing-sm);
    padding-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--surface-container-high);
  }
  
  .card-icon {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    color: var(--primary);
  }
  
  .card-title {
    font-size: 20px;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--on-surface);
  }
  
  .card-text {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--on-surface-variant);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  
  /* Services Section */
  .services-section {
    padding: var(--spacing-xl) 0;
  }
  
  .align-left {
    text-align: left;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
  }
  
  .align-left .section-title {
    justify-content: flex-start;
  }
  
  .align-left .section-subtitle {
    margin: var(--spacing-sm) 0 0 0;
  }

  .services-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: var(--spacing-xl);
  }
  
  .service-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: var(--spacing-xl) var(--spacing-lg);
    background: var(--surface-container-low);
    border: 1px solid var(--surface-container-high);
  }
  
  .service-icon-wrapper {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
  }
  
  .service-icon {
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    color: var(--on-surface-variant);
  }
  
  .service-title {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 24px;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
    color: var(--on-surface);
  }
  
  .service-text {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--on-surface-variant);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
  }
  
  .service-link {
    margin-top: auto;
    align-self: flex-end;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--spacing-xs);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-family: var(--font-brand);
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--on-surface);
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }
  
  .service-link svg {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
  }
  
  .service-card:hover .service-link {
    color: var(--primary);
  }
  
  .service-card:hover .service-link svg {
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .hero-container {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .hero-description {
      margin: 0 auto var(--spacing-xl);
    }
    .hero-actions {
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .portal-ring {
      margin-top: var(--spacing-xl);
      width: 280px;
      height: 280px;
    }
    .portal-core {
      width: 180px;
      height: 180px;
    }
    .display-title {
      font-size: 40px;
    }
    
    .factor-grid > .card {
      width: 100%;
    }
    
    .services-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
